# CyberTalents - Invisible Write-Up

- **Category:** Digital Forensics
- **Difficulty:** Medium
- **Tools Used:** Volatility 3, Strings, Foremost, Poppler-utils (pdfimages)

---

## Challenge Description

> Can you see what I can see?  
> Note: better to use Volatility 3.

